    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_01",
      "hash64": "45295A139DA1350B",
      "text": "Ah, [VAR 0x0100(0000)] !\\nAlors, comment se passe le voyage scolaire ?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_select_01",
      "hash64": "1D7149A78716880D",
      "text": "Monsieur Jacq ?!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_select_02",
      "hash64": "1D7146A7871682F4",
      "text": "Qu’est-ce que vous faites ici ?!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_02",
      "hash64": "45295B139DA136BE",
      "text": "Je suis venu voir comment tu t’en sortais.\\nC’est ma responsabilité, après tout ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_03",
      "hash64": "45295C139DA13871",
      "text": "Et j’ai décidé d’en profiter pour faire quelques\\nrecherches sur les Pokémon de Septentria...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_04",
      "hash64": "45295D139DA13A24",
      "text": "Oh là là ! Excuse-moi ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_05",
      "hash64": "45295E139DA13BD7",
      "text": "J’étais tellement absorbé par mes recherches\\nque j’ai failli à mon objectif premier, qui était\\r\\nde venir te voir...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_06",
      "hash64": "45295F139DA13D8A",
      "text": "Oh, je sais ! Laisse-moi t’inviter à un pique-nique\\npour me faire pardonner.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_07",
      "hash64": "452960139DA13F3D",
      "text": "Ça tombe bien, j’avais justement demandé\\nà monsieur Clavel de me prêter son nécessaire\\r\\nà pique-nique ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_08",
      "hash64": "452951139DA125C0",
      "text": "Allez, mange donc ce Sandwich ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_09",
      "hash64": "452952139DA12773",
      "text": "Ne fais pas attention à son aspect un peu\\nfade, je t’assure qu’il est délicieux ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_10",
      "hash64": "452CDF139DA44CE1",
      "text": "Moi qui ai plutôt l’habitude de rester dans mon\\nlabo, j’ignorais que les recherches sur le terrain\\r\\npouvaient être si fatigantes...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_11",
      "hash64": "452CDE139DA44B2E",
      "text": "Je ne peux qu’admirer les gens comme toi, qui\\nparcourent le monde pour leur Chasse au Trésor ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_12",
      "hash64": "452CDD139DA4497B",
      "text": "... Tiens ?\\nIl y a quelque chose dans le panier...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_13",
      "hash64": "452CDC139DA447C8",
      "text": "Ta-daaaaah ! ♪[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_14",
      "hash64": "452CE3139DA453AD",
      "text": "C’est un Œuf de Pokémon ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_15",
      "hash64": "452CE2139DA451FA",
      "text": "C’est tout de même étrange qu’il soit apparu\\ndans ce panier alors qu’il n’y a qu’un Gloupti\\r\\nà ce pique-nique...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_select_03",
      "hash64": "1D7147A7871684A7",
      "text": "Comment ça se fait ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_select_04",
      "hash64": "1D7144A787167F8E",
      "text": "C’est vous qui l’avez apporté ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_16",
      "hash64": "452CE1139DA45047",
      "text": "Hé hé... En fait, c’est moi qui ai apporté l’Œuf ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_17",
      "hash64": "452CE0139DA44E94",
      "text": "Hé hé... On ne peut rien te cacher ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_18",
      "hash64": "452CD7139DA43F49",
      "text": "Comme tu le sais déjà, des Œufs de Pokémon\\napparaissent parfois pendant les pique-niques.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_19",
      "hash64": "452CD6139DA43D96",
      "text": "Jusqu’à présent, lorsque quelqu’un ne pouvait\\npas s’occuper d’un Œuf, nous le recueillions\\r\\nà l’académie et l’élevions nous-mêmes.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_20",
      "hash64": "453065139DA7666A",
      "text": "Mais j’ai pensé qu’il serait tout aussi intéressant\\nde les confier à des Dresseuses et des Dresseurs\\r\\nde talent venus de toutes les régions ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_21",
      "hash64": "453066139DA7681D",
      "text": "C’est pour cette raison que je te remets ceci,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)] ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_system_01",
      "hash64": "4CE7DECB5A676AEA",
      "text": "Jacq vous confie un Œuf de Pokémon !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_22",
      "hash64": "453063139DA76304",
      "text": "Je suis conscient que c’est un peu étrange de\\nvoyager jusqu’à Septentria juste pour te donner\\r\\nun Œuf, mais... je voulais m’assurer qu’il est entre\\r\\nde bonnes mains ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 149,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 170,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_23",
      "hash64": "453064139DA764B7",
      "text": "D’ailleurs, est-ce que tu continues d’utiliser\\nl’appli Pokédex ?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_24",
      "hash64": "453061139DA75F9E",
      "text": "Sache que tous les Pokémon que tu captureras\\nici seront ajoutés au Pokédex de Septentria.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_25",
      "hash64": "453062139DA76151",
      "text": "Quant à moi, je vais rester stationné ici pour\\nfaire quelques recherches.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "s1_sub_001_ecology_26",
      "hash64": "45305F139DA75C38",
      "text": "N’hésite pas à venir me voir une fois que tu auras\\ncomplété le Pokédex de Septentria ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
